   "s": 17.005,
   "e": 17.285
  },
  {
   "text": "the car sped up,",
   "s": 17.669,
   "e": 18.386
  },
  {
   "text": "climbed a giant curved ramp and hung upside down.",
   "s": 18.803,
   "e": 21.438
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it let go,",
   "s": 21.927,
   "e": 22.694
  },
  {
   "text": "flew spinning through the air and landed in a cloud of white smoke.",
   "s": 22.968,
   "e": 25.951
  },
  {
   "text": "The second trick:",
